This product includes software developed at inno³, an independent consultancy
specialised in open-source and open-innovation strategy, legal and compliance.

The connectors in this repository were originally built by inno³ to let MCP
clients (Claude Desktop, Cowork, and any other Model Context Protocol client)
interact with the free and open-source tools that make up inno³'s own
information system — Dolibarr, Kanboard, WordPress, n8n, Matrix, Nextcloud,
HedgeDoc and GitLab. They are released here as a generic, vendor-neutral
toolkit so that any organisation running these tools can reuse them, and so
that inno³ can migrate its own usage onto the public code base.

